            "review_title": "Review at Mp Seafood Restaurant",
            "review_text": "Nguyen K\n8 contributions\n0\nBest view in Nha Trang\nJan 2025 • Couples\nVery nice location. You can watch the sea and enjoy coffee. There is also hot pot in the evening. The view is close to the beach, I have taken many pictures here. You should come and experience it.\nInsider tip:\nYou should come in the afternoon at 4pm. You will see the sunset and in the evening when Nha Trang city lights up, it will be very beautiful\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten February 25, 2025",
